<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Photo on 0x32++</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/tags/photo/</link><description>Recent content in Photo on 0x32++</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 11 Sep 2026 09:45:00 +0100</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.0x32.co.uk/tags/photo/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Morning Mist at the Pool</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/morning-mist-at-the-pool/</link><pubDate>Fri, 11 Sep 2026 09:45:00 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/morning-mist-at-the-pool/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Took this walking to the swimming pool this morning. The fog was sitting low over the field, backlit by the rising sun and cutting the trees off at the knees. Found it very atmospheric, almost other worldly.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;figure class="wp-caption alignnone"&gt;&#10; &lt;a data-flickr-embed="true" data-header="true" data-footer="false"&#10; data-context="false"&#10; href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/doodle_m/55520347637"&#10; title="Morning Mist"&gt;&#10; &lt;img src="https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/55520347637_d3d372b593_z.jpg" width="800" alt="Morning Mist" /&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&lt;script async src="//embedr.flickr.com/assets/client-code.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&#10; &lt;figcaption class="wp-caption-text"&gt;Fog sitting low over the field on the way to the pool, backlit by the rising sun.&lt;/figcaption&gt;&#10; &lt;/figure&gt;</description></item><item><title>3D Printing Album</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/3d-printing-album/</link><pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/3d-printing-album/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Flickr album collecting prints off the &lt;a href="https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/bambu-lab-a1-mini/"&gt;Bambu Lab A1 Mini&lt;/a&gt; — a running photo dump alongside the &lt;a href="https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/bambu-a1-mini-prints-so-far/"&gt;write-ups&lt;/a&gt;, updated as new prints come off the bed.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;a data-flickr-embed="true" data-header="true" data-footer="true"&#10;href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/doodle_m/albums/72177720335139451"&#10;title="3D Printing"&gt;&#10;&lt;img src="https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/55450859801_298a10ccd4_c.jpg"&#10;width="800" height="600"&#10;alt="3D Printing"&gt;&#10;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;script async src="//embedr.flickr.com/assets/client-code.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;</description></item><item><title>Notebook Doodles</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/notebook_doodles/</link><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/notebook_doodles/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Squid doodles.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;figure class="wp-caption alignnone"&gt;&#10; &lt;a data-flickr-embed="true" data-header="true" data-footer="false"&#10; data-context="false"&#10; href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/doodle_m/55338622285"&#10; title="Notebook Doodles"&gt;&#10; &lt;img src="https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/55338622285_ec6ca5cfb8_c.jpg" width="800" alt="Notebook Doodles" /&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&lt;script async src="//embedr.flickr.com/assets/client-code.js" charset="utf-8"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&#10; &lt;figcaption class="wp-caption-text"&gt;Squid doodles&lt;/figcaption&gt;&#10; &lt;/figure&gt;</description></item><item><title>Sidney too Warm</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/sidney/</link><pubDate>Tue, 12 Aug 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/sidney/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Sidney feeling the heat today, he has melted.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;figure class="wp-caption alignnone"&gt;&#10; &lt;a data-flickr-embed="true" data-header="true" data-footer="false"&#10; data-context="false"&#10; href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/doodle_m/54714811497"&#10; title="Hot Doggie"&gt;&#10; &lt;img src="https