rs documentary on NetFlix decided to start back trying to learn to solve the cube from memory rather than following the instructions.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;So far I can get upto the middle layer without refering to the online walk through instructions.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/50237828942_db50de5807_z.jpg" alt="Cubes"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://flic.kr/p/2jxm1hw"&gt;Cubes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Fidget</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/fidget/</link><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2020 09:41:29 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/fidget/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;With WFH since March I have been finding myself fidgetting more while on video calls.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Usually with a lump of Blu-Tak (other options are available), but got this delivered yesterday to keep my fingers busy.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/50217818187_eb5218bf94_z.jpg" alt="Fidge Widget"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Rainbow Photo</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/rainbow_photo/</link><pubDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2020 14:19:06 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/rainbow_photo/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/50154392968_9c8cca2caf_b.jpg" alt="Rainbow Light"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/doodle_m/50154392968"&gt;Rainbow Light&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Picture test</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/picture_test/</link><pubDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2020 11:46:43 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/picture_test/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Testing including pictures from my Flickr Account&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/50179510847_75e14e6af9_b.jpg" alt="Rusty"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/doodle_m/50179510